H2 chain, LDA: wavefunction optimisation with a 2x2x2 Monkhorst-Pack k-point mesh

&CPMD
 OPTIMIZE WAVEFUNCTION
 CONVERGENCE ORBITALS
  1.0d-6
&END
&SYSTEM
 ANGSTROM
 SYMMETRY
  1
 CELL
  3.0 1.0 1.0 0.0 0.0 0.0
 CUTOFF
  30.0
 KPOINTS MONKHORST-PACK
  2 2 2
&END
&DFT
 FUNCTIONAL LDA
&END
&ATOMS
*H_GO.psp
 LMAX=S
  2
  0.0 0.0 0.0
  0.74 0.0 0.0
&END
